+/** Inset of the retrace rect from the cell rect, in the cell's ghost units. A 12-unit pass and a
+ *  15-unit pass 8 apart fuse into a 21.5-unit band (20 units on a board under 375 device pixels,
+ *  where the second pass is 12). Why the pixel decides is in gameCell.css's `.cell-ghost-retrace`. */
